/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1137:front.shopping.delivery_modal.yupack.note2: "※In the event of a postal accident, compensation is generally limited to actual damages up to ¥500,000."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1138:front.shopping.delivery_modal.yupack.note3: "※If a package is not received and returned after the holding period, an additional shipping fee may be charged."
