/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1151:front.shopping.payment_modal.deadline.body: "Payment is due by 15:00 (JST) on the 7th day after the order date.<br>If the due date falls on a holiday for financial institutions, the deadline will be 15:00 on the next business day.<br>-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-<br>Example: If ordered on April 1, the deadline is 15:00 on April 7.<br>(If April 7 is a Sunday, the deadline is 15:00 on April 8.)<br>-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-<br>※Orders past the payment deadline will be cancelled. If your payment will be delayed, please contact us in advance."
