/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1219:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.shipping.li1: "Pre-order items are scheduled to ship on the official release date. (※We may ship the day before the release date in some cases.)"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1220:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.shipping.li2: If you request delivery before the release date, your order will ship on or after the official release date.
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1221:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.shipping.li3: "For customers who do not specify a delivery date, we will ship as quickly as possible after the release date."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1222:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.shipping.note: "※In rare cases, packages may not arrive on the specified date due to traffic or weather conditions. We are not responsible for such delays."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1223:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.congestion.title: ・Notice on High Demand
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1224:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.congestion.body: "We receive a large volume of orders on new set release days.<br>While we guarantee same-day shipping, there may be delays compared to normal. We appreciate your understanding."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1225:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.heading: Return and Exchange Policy
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1226:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.customer.title: Returns / Exchanges for Customer Convenience
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1227:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.customer.body: "The products we handle are predominantly used goods (secondhand items), many of which are one-of-a-kind. For this reason, we cannot accept returns or exchanges based on customer convenience (e.g., \"it was different from what I imagined,\" \"I ordered by mistake\"), except in cases of product non-conformity."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1228:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.nonconformity.title: Returns / Exchanges Due to Product Non-conformity
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1229:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.nonconformity.policy.title: ① Basic Policy
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1230:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.nonconformity.policy.body: "If the delivered product differs from your order, or falls under the non-conformity conditions defined below, please contact us within 8 days of receiving your order. We will arrange an exchange or refund (return) at our shipping expense."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1231:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.nonconformity.condition.title: ② Product Condition and Contract Details
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1232:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.nonconformity.condition.body1: "We inspect and describe product conditions on our product pages based on our own standards, taking into account the nature of used goods, in order to provide customers with an accurate understanding of item condition. Detailed condition standards are available on a separate page."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1233:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.nonconformity.condition.body2: "Customers are deemed to have read and agreed to the product condition descriptions on the product page and in our standards before making a purchase.<br>The product condition described on the product page constitutes the agreed quality terms between the customer and our company."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1234:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.nonconformity.applicable.title: "③ Cases Eligible for Return / Exchange (Non-conformity)"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1235:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.nonconformity.applicable.li1: The delivered product differs from the ordered product.
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1236:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.nonconformity.applicable.li2: The product has obvious damage not described on the product page or in our detailed condition standards.
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1237:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.nonconformity.not_applicable.title: "④ Cases Not Eligible for Return / Exchange"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1238:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.nonconformity.not_applicable.li1: "Scratches, stains, or age-related deterioration already noted on the product page."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1239:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.nonconformity.not_applicable.li2: "Cases where the customer's subjective assessment (e.g., \"the damage is more noticeable than I expected\") does not conflict with the product condition description provided on the product page."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1240:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.nonconformity.not_applicable.li3: "9 or more days have passed since the product was received."
